To address your request, I will update the following files:

1.  **`types.ts`**: Update `ActiveMentorship` interface to include optional `mentoringType` and `programType` fields.
2.  **`components/ActiveMentorshipCard.tsx`**: Update the card to display badges for Mentoring Type (Group/One-on-One) and Program Type (Open/Closed). The Program Type badge will be conditionally rendered based on the user role (visible only to mentors).
3.  **`pages/MenteeJourneyPage.tsx`**: Update the mock data for active programs to include examples of all four combinations (One-on-One Closed, One-on-One Open, Group Open, Group Closed).
4.  **`pages/MentorJourneyPage.tsx`**: Introduce a mock data array for active programs with the four combinations and update the render logic to display them.

Here are the changes:

